# The 7 Habits of Highly Effective People - Stephen R. Covey

Stephen R. Covey's *The 7 Habits of Highly Effective People* is a foundational text on personal effectiveness and leadership. The book outlines seven habits that, when practiced, lead to personal and professional success.

## Key Concepts

- Be Proactive
- Begin with the End in Mind
- Put First Things First
- Think Win-Win
- Seek First to Understand, Then to Be Understood
- Synergize
- Sharpen the Saw

## Relevance

This work is referenced as a source for the [[ideas-mental-model]], where habit-based effectiveness and proactive thinking serve as conceptual tools for navigating complex situations.